## **FPOs (Farmer Producer Organization)**

> **And recent government reporting says 10,000 FPOs (Farmer Producer Organization) had been registered by Dec 2025, while e-NAM reported 4,698 FPOs on its network at that time.**
> 

**100 farmers → FPO → 20 tonnes of tomatoes → Buyer**

(so probelm related to FPOs quiet solved and helps them also)

### Existing FPO

**Farmers → Existing FPO → Aggregate → Register in our Platform → Buyers → Best Buyer → Logistics → Delivery → Settlement**

### No FPO / Direct farmer aggregation

**Farmers → Your Platform → Aggregate Farmers → Buyer → Logistics → Delivery → Settlement**

So the key difference is:

**With FPO:** aggregation already exists.

**Without FPO:** **your platform creates the aggregation layer**
